    "canonical_ref": "Heges.III.4.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But, when the sacred band of apostles had in various ways closed their lives, and that generation of men to whom it had been vouchsafed to listen to the Godlike Wisdom with their own ears had passed away,",
