    "canonical_ref": "Heges.IV.2.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "On my arrival at Rome, I drew up a list of the succession of bishops down to Anicetus, whose deacon was Eleutherus. To Anicetus succeeded Soter, and after him came Eleutherus.",
    "chunk_index": 71,
